{
  "id": "E332",
  "title": "On the Horse",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-06-16",
  "synopsis": "What do Chinese people really mean when they say “on the horse”?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1073/32d6e438f30e8f47a48994aaa0158938daea85a0.mp3?1560164254",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "马上\n\n王总：小何，请你马上到我办公室来一下\n小何：好的，经理，我马上来。\n（在经理的办公室）\n王总：我马上要去开会了，需要30份材料。麻烦你帮我打印一下，然后马上送到会议室。\n小何：好的经理，我马上去做。",
    "traditional": "馬上\n\n王總：小何，請你馬上到我辦公室來一下\n小何：好的，經理，我馬上來。\n（在經理的辦公室）\n王總：我馬上要去開會了，需要30份材料。麻煩你幫我打印一下，然後馬上送到會議室。\n小何：好的經理，我馬上去做。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "On the Horse"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王总：小何，请你马上到我办公室来一下",
      "traditional": "王總：小何，請你馬上到我辦公室來一下",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiǎo hé qǐng nǐ mǎ shàng dào wǒ bàn gōng shì lái yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little He, please come to my office immediately."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：好的，经理，我马上来。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的，經理，我馬上來。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de jīng lǐ wǒ mǎ shàng lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ok, manager, I’ll come immediately."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "（在经理的办公室）",
      "traditional": "（在經理的辦公室）",
      "pinyin": "zài jīng lǐ de bàn gōng shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(In the manager’s office)"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "王总：我马上要去开会了，需要30份材料。",
      "traditional": "王總：我馬上要去開會了，需要30份材料。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng wǒ mǎ shàng yào qù kāi huì le xū yào 2 fèn cái liào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "麻烦你帮我打印一下，然后马上送到会议室。",
      "traditional": "麻煩你幫我打印一下，然後馬上送到會議室。",
      "pinyin": "má fan nǐ bāng wǒ dǎ yìn yí xià rán hòu mǎ shàng sòng dào huì yì shì",
      "english": "Manager Wang: I’m going to a meeting soon, I need 30 copies of this material."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Please help me print for a bit, and then deliver them to the meeting room immediately."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小何：好的经理，我马上去做。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的經理，我馬上去做。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de jīng lǐ wǒ mǎ shàng qù zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ok, manager. I’ll do it right away."
    }
  ],
